      "houseId": "avant_garde",
      "status": "assessed",
      "score": 5.5,
      "remarks": "The combination of wool and tweed is conventional; the design lacks boldness or unconventional juxtapositions to qualify as avant-garde."
    },
    {
      "houseId": "atelier",
      "status": "assessed",
      "score": 7.5,
      "remarks": "The proportions are well-defined with a natural waist and fitted skirt. The seam lines and paneling suggest a clean, structured construction."
    }
